`,(0,n.jsxs)(i,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"I'm setting up a Project for NDA reviews at our firm. We handle about 30 NDAs a week and I want Claude to reference our standard terms, flag deviations, and maintain consistency in our review comments."}),(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:["I've uploaded our NDA playbook, our standard mutual NDA template, and our list of unacceptable terms. ",(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Analyze these documents"})," and create an NDA Review Standards Guide that captures our voice, tone, and structure we use throughout our writing. Make this a ",(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"professional reference document"})," I can upload to the Project knowledge, so Claude can reference it during every review."]}),(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:["Then help me craft optimized ",(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"project instructions"})," I can paste into the custom instructions field—instructions that tell Claude to reference the standards guide and apply our approach."]})]}),`
