`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"If your playbook is thorough and your templates are up to date, Claude's standards guide will be stronger. If you're working from informal tribal knowledge, consider using this as an opportunity to formalize your approach first, then have Claude systematize it."}),`
